	(text "PR1(pin6)=driven by 3A-detect 2N7002 inverter, 17.8k/10.0k EXT_5V to GND2. Switchback: approx 4.18V nominal, worst-case 3.92-4.54V -- measure at bring-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185 18 0)
		(effects
